/*
  ============================================================
  ESP32-S3 Advanced Wireless IDS (WIDS) - Deep Sight Edition v4.0
  ============================================================
  
  CORE FEATURES:
  - Passive WiFi Sniffing (802.11b/g/n/ax)
  - WPA2/WPA3 Handshake & PMKID Capture (Passive)
  - WPA3-SAE, Wi-Fi 6 (HE), Mesh Network Detection
  
  INTELLIGENCE FEATURES (v4.0 EXPANSION):
  - Threat Scoring Algorithm (0-100 risk per AP)
  - Auto-Tagging (Public, Enterprise, Personal, IoT, Suspicious)
  - Delta Logging (80% storage savings)
  - Client-to-AP Mapping (Who is connected to whom?)
  - WPS PIN Enumeration (Passive logging of exposed PINs)
  - Channel Utilization & Noise Floor Analysis
  - WPA3 Transition Mode Detection (Mixed Mode)
  - Hidden SSID Detection (Via Probe Responses)
  - Deauthentication Forensics (Passive logging of kicks)
  
  OPERATIONAL UTILITIES:
  - HTML Report Generator (Includes Client Map & Noise Stats)
  - Battery Saver Mode (Extended deployment)
  - PMKID Hashcat Formatting
  
  STABILITY FEATURES:
  - ESP32 v3 Compatible (No F() in printf)
  - Watchdog Protection (10s timeout + yield())
  - Memory Optimization (DHCP disabled, Static Buffers)
  - Robust SD I/O (Retry logic)
  
  HARDWARE REQUIRED:
  - ESP32-S3 Dev Module (OPI PSRAM Enabled, 16MB Flash)
  - 0.96" SSD1306 OLED (I2C, 0x3C)
  - GPS Module (UART, 9600 baud)
  - MicroSD Card Module (SPI, CS=10)
  - Piezo Buzzer (GPIO 42)
  - DS3231 RTC Module (I2C, optional)
  - 5x Tactile Buttons (Pull-up, GPIOs 47/48/46/43/44)
  - 3.7V LiPo + ADC Voltage Divider (GPIO 2)
  
  LIBRARIES:
  - TinyGPSPlus, RTClib, Adafruit SSD1306, Adafruit GFX, NimBLE-Arduino
*/

